SUMMARY:[OOPSLA 26] R1 Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Extracted automatically by a small language model\; please cro
 ss-check against the source before relying on it: https://2026.splashcon.
 org/track/oopsla-2026\n\nOOPSLA is a track of SPLASH 2026.\n\nPapers must
  be submitted via HotCRP at https://oopsla26.hotcrp.com/. Initial submiss
 ions must be at most 23 pages\; revisions can go up to 25 pages. PACMPL(O
 OPSLA) uses double-blind reviewing with two rounds of review. At least on
 e senior author must register as a reserve reviewer unless exempt. Papers
  accepted in either round will be published in the 2026 volume of PACMPL 
 and invited to present in-person at the SPLASH conference in 2026\; remot
 e presentations are not possible.\n\nSubmit at: https://oopsla26.hotcrp.c
 om/\n\nhttps://github.com/JonasAlaif/pl-conferences
END:VEVENT
